# Python bytecode. Two .pyc files were committed by accident and travelled through
# a branch merge before anyone noticed; nothing in the repo is generated from them.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local-only review surfaces. Anything committed here is served by Vercel - that is
# how assets/articles.json came to be publicly downloadable with all 41 internal
# notes in it. A rendered, browsable index of corpus-internal/ must never be
# committed; generate it with scripts/internal-review.py and read it from disk.
*.local.html
